    <detaileddescription>
<para>Exposes AQL parsing capabilities as a service interface for external consumers (particularly src/aql/ LLM integration layer).</para>
<para>ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE: src/aql/ depends on src/query/ interfaces ONLY. No reverse dependency (src/query/ does NOT depend on src/aql/).</para>
